    "dynamic_instructions": "{\r\n  \"results\": \"#Test a Fix\\n\\n###Data Tracing Steps\\n\\n**Step One**: Retest the example from Level 4: \\\"_Interview: the famous lead talks about the movie on premiere night_\\\"\\n\\n>**Clip Type**: Interview  \\n> **Length**: Long  \\n> **Famous Actor**: Yes  \\n> **Funny**: No  \\n\\n**Step Two** - Click the _Replay_ button to trace the path through the tree.\\n\\n**Step Three** - Check the training data by clicking the decision node and clicking on _Training rows_.\\n\\nWas your prediction correct? Why or why not?\\n\",\r\n  \"datasetView\": \"#Test a Fix\\n\\nSeveral new _Interview_ clips were added to the training data. \\n\\nClick on the **Filter** button and choose:\\n\\n> Clip Type: Interview  \\n\\nExamine the new training data and make a prediction in your Activity Guide as to whether this new data will fix the model's incorrect prediction. Why or why not?\\n\\nTrain your new decision tree.\"\r\n}",
